 "response": {
  "text": "Bilkul 😊 Agar **budget mein shaadi ke liye sarees** chahiye, toh ₹800–₹2,500 range mein kaafi achhe options mil rahe hain. Wedding guest ke liye **Banarasi, organza aur soft-silk** sabse “expensive-looking” choices hain. [thepanaya.com](https://thepanaya.com/blogs/the-panaya/best-banarasi-sarees-under-rs-5000?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### 💛 Traditional & classy — Banarasi\n### [Banarasee Organza Mix Saree Zari]()\n*₹1,999*\n\n### [Banarasee Handwoven Semi Silk Saree]()\n*₹2,399*\n\n### [Mysilklove Amber Yellow Woven Banarasi Saree]()\n*₹2,224*\n\n### [Banarasi Sarees Floral Saree]()\n*₹1,567*\n\n**Budget:** roughly ₹1,500–₹2,500  \n**Best colours:** rani pink, bottle green, wine, mustard, royal blue.  \nBanarasi georgette/kora types especially achhe hain agar traditional look chahiye but heavy saree nahi. [thepanaya.com](https://thepanaya.com/blogs/the-panaya/best-banarasi-sarees-under-rs-5000?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[thepanaya.com](https://thepanaya.com/blogs/the-panaya/best-banarasi-sarees-under-rs-10000?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### ✨ Modern & elegant — Organza\n### [SADALA CULTURE Soft Lightweight Organza Saree]()\n*₹949*\n\n### [Yashika Organza Satin Butti Work Saree]()\n*₹1,799*\n\n### [Flosive Shimmer Organza Sequence Embroidery Saree]()\n*₹846.09*\n\n### [Yashika Organza Saree with Blouse Piece]()\n*₹761*\n\n**Budget:** roughly ₹750–₹1,800  \nDay wedding, engagement ya reception ke liye bahut pretty lagegi. Organza mein **small butti + zari border** wala design budget mein bhi polished dikhta hai. Current online listings mein ₹1,000–₹2,000 ke aas-paas kaafi options hain. [www.myntra.com](https://www.myntra.com/organza-silk-saree-wedding?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### 🌸 Soft-silk / festive look\n### [Bridal Kanchi Semi Soft Silk Saree]()\n*₹1,750*\n\n### [Purple Soft Silk Saree]()\n*₹1,699*\n\n### [Koskii Navy Blue Soft Raw Silk Gold Saree]()\n*₹1,494*\n\n**Meri tip:** Agar **₹2,000 ke andar** lena hai, toh main **Banarasi ya organza** choose karungi—ye photos mein bhi festive aur shaadi-appropriate lagte hain.\n\nAgar tum mujhe **budget (₹1,000 / ₹1,500 / ₹2,000 / ₹3,000), shaadi mein tumhara relation (bride ki sister/friend/aunty etc.) aur colour preference** bata do, main uske hisaab se exact sarees shortlist kar dungi.",
